# Rust
/target/
**/target/
*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# The generated ABI code under crates/hematite-gl-frontend/src/gen/ IS tracked, even
# though `cargo run -p xtask -- gen-abi` produces it: a fresh checkout has to pass
# `cargo check --workspace` before anyone runs the generator. `./build.sh abi`
# regenerates, formats and fails if the tracked copy differs.

# Node (tools/check_syntax.mjs)
/node_modules/
/package-lock.json

# Build outputs
# dist/ is ignored except the bring-up APK, which is committed so it has a stable
# download URL. (/dist/* rather than /dist/ so the exception can take effect.)
/dist/*
!/dist/hematite-debug.apk
*.apk
!hematite-debug.apk
*.aab
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Local tooling
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Runtime output that must never be committed
/hematite-logs/
/dumps/
*.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Downloaded fallback compiler and WASI test output
/.cache/
